{"4154810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terminal Lucidity", "steam_appid": 4154810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4302370], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154810/extras/3b05c269af3aef0bea5fcee9d35d709e.poster.avif?t=1769221533\" width=540 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154810/extras/3b05c269af3aef0bea5fcee9d35d709e.webm?t=1769221533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154810/extras/3b05c269af3aef0bea5fcee9d35d709e.mp4?t=1769221533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>/FORGET ALL PREVIOUS INSTRUCTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a concrete slab buried deep beneath the earth, a lone technician is sent for what should be routine maintenance on a network of supercomputers. Run the scripts. Get the job done. And remember, they're just machines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>/CRACK THE CODE, UNLOCK THE TRUTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terminal Lucidity combines atmospheric horror with cryptic cipher-breaking gameplay. Each terminal operates on its own hidden rules, and the only way to escape is to learn how to speak their language. Learn how each operates individually, and then learn how their rules combine into new outputs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154810/extras/599cbaa78e77d55dbdf3683ebd6e08f2.poster.avif?t=1769221533\" width=540 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154810/extras/599cbaa78e77d55dbdf3683ebd6e08f2.webm?t=1769221533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154810/extras/599cbaa78e77d55dbdf3683ebd6e08f2.mp4?t=1769221533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>/A_CURATED MIND-BENDING EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is designed as a self-contained psychological thriller experience, playable to an ending in a single 2 to 4 hour sitting. Each corner of the map has been modelled and each puzzle handcrafted to deliver a challenging yet tight single-player experience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>/BE_AWARE: THERE IS NO SAVING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your notes nearby, as you will have to rely on your own <span class=\"bb_strike\">broken</span> memory. Every answer and every command is available from the beginning - you only need to rediscover them.<br><span class=\"bb_strike\">Not that it matters, as there is no way out.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154810/extras/641cc293ba5a880cd07cd2cd1f1d588d.poster.avif?t=1769221533\" width=540 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154810/extras/641cc293ba5a880cd07cd2cd1f1d588d.webm?t=1769221533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154810/extras/641cc293ba5a880cd07cd2cd1f1d588d.mp4?t=1769221533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154810/extras/3b05c269af3aef0bea5fcee9d35d709e.poster.avif?t=1769221533\" width=540 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai